/-!
# Coefficient construction and surjectivity for completed monomial charts

Source: ILO, Travaux de Gabber, Exposé VI 1.6(i)--(ii), printed p. 70;
Stacks Project, Algebra, Theorem 032A and its final paragraph
(blueprint: lem-trf-completed-chart-coefficient-surjection).

The polynomial and completed rings and their two ideals are the existing
`AddMonoidAlgebra` local-model constructions. `CompletedChartSurjection` packages
only the specified completion and evaluation properties, with no chosen map.
-/

@[expose] public section

set_option autoImplicit false

universe u v w

noncomputable section

namespace AddMonoidAlgebra

/-- The surjection clause for a prescribed coefficient map and parameter lifts.
The evaluation equality specifies the finite-sum map on the whole polynomial ring.
The last two equalities concern set images, not merely ideals generated by images.
Both topologies are explicitly the topologies of the extended completion ideals.
Source: ILO VI 1.6(i)--(ii), p. 70; Stacks 032A, final paragraph
(blueprint: lem-trf-completed-chart-coefficient-surjection). -/
def CompletedChartSurjection
    (A : Type u) [CommRing A] [IsLocalRing A] [IsNoetherianRing A]
    (P : Type v) [AddCommMonoid P] (a : Multiplicative P →* A)
    (n : ℕ) (u : Fin n → A) (L : Type w) [CommRing L] [IsLocalRing L]
    (coeffMap : L →+* AdicCompletion (IsLocalRing.maximalIdeal A) A) : Prop :=
  ∃ hB : IsLocalRing (CompletedLocalModel L P n),
    @IsLocalRing.maximalIdeal (CompletedLocalModel L P n) _ hB =
      (localModelCompletionIdeal L P n).map
        (algebraMap _ (CompletedLocalModel L P n)) ∧
    IsAdicComplete
      ((localModelCompletionIdeal L P n).map (algebraMap _ (CompletedLocalModel L P n)))
      (CompletedLocalModel L P n) ∧
    ∃ φ : CompletedLocalModel L P n →+* AdicCompletion (IsLocalRing.maximalIdeal A) A,
      IsLocalHom φ ∧ Function.Surjective φ ∧
      @Continuous _ _
        ((localModelCompletionIdeal L P n).map
          (algebraMap _ (CompletedLocalModel L P n))).adicTopology
        ((IsLocalRing.maximalIdeal A).map
          (algebraMap A (AdicCompletion (IsLocalRing.maximalIdeal A) A))).adicTopology φ ∧
      (∀ f : MvPolynomial (Fin n) (AddMonoidAlgebra L P),
        φ (algebraMap _ (CompletedLocalModel L P n) f) =
          MvPolynomial.eval₂Hom
            (liftNCRingHom coeffMap
              ((algebraMap A (AdicCompletion (IsLocalRing.maximalIdeal A) A)).toMonoidHom.comp a)
              (fun _c _q ↦ Commute.all _ _))
            (fun i ↦ algebraMap A (AdicCompletion (IsLocalRing.maximalIdeal A) A) (u i)) f) ∧
      (∀ q : P,
        φ (algebraMap (MvPolynomial (Fin n) (AddMonoidAlgebra L P))
          (CompletedLocalModel L P n) (MvPolynomial.C (single q (1 : L)))) =
          algebraMap A (AdicCompletion (IsLocalRing.maximalIdeal A) A) (a (.ofAdd q))) ∧
      (∀ i : Fin n,
        φ (algebraMap (MvPolynomial (Fin n) (AddMonoidAlgebra L P))
          (CompletedLocalModel L P n) (MvPolynomial.X i)) =
          algebraMap A (AdicCompletion (IsLocalRing.maximalIdeal A) A) (u i)) ∧
      φ '' (((localModelCompletionIdeal L P n).map
        (algebraMap _ (CompletedLocalModel L P n))) : Set (CompletedLocalModel L P n)) =
        (((IsLocalRing.maximalIdeal A).map
          (algebraMap A (AdicCompletion (IsLocalRing.maximalIdeal A) A))) :
            Set (AdicCompletion (IsLocalRing.maximalIdeal A) A)) ∧
      φ '' (completedLocalModelBoundaryIdeal L P n : Set (CompletedLocalModel L P n)) =
        (((IsLocalRing.maximalIdeal A).map
          (algebraMap A (AdicCompletion (IsLocalRing.maximalIdeal A) A))) :
            Set (AdicCompletion (IsLocalRing.maximalIdeal A) A))

/-- Coefficient construction and local surjection for a completed monomial chart.
Source: ILO VI 1.6(i)--(ii), printed p. 70; Stacks 032A
(blueprint: lem-trf-completed-chart-coefficient-surjection).

Proof plan:
1. The chosen regular parameters generate the quotient maximal ideal, so lifting
   their linear combinations gives m = I + (u_i).
2. Noetherianity makes m finitely generated. Apply
   lem-weil-pbc-adic-completion-mod-ideal, lem-weil-pbc-adic-completion-noetherian,
   lem-weil-pbc-local-completion-local-ring and lem-weil-pbc-completion-dimension
   to obtain all asserted properties of S.
3. If A contains a field, apply lem-weil-pbc-cohen-coefficient-ring-exists to S.
   Its coefficient subring has zero intersection with mS: in characteristic zero
   this is the definition, and in characteristic p the contained field forces pS=0.
   Invert its residue isomorphism to obtain the section k -> S.
4. Otherwise residue characteristic zero would make every positive integer a unit
   of A and embed Q in A. Thus the residue characteristic is prime p. Use
   lem-weil-pbc-cohen-rings-exist and lem-weil-pbc-cohen-ring-lift-complete-local
   to lift the chosen C/pC = k isomorphism into S; no injectivity is asserted.
5. Finite generation of P makes the completion ideal finitely generated. Sharpness
   makes constant coefficient multiplicative and identifies E/a with k. Apply
   lem-weil-pbc-adic-completion-mod-ideal to obtain completeness of B.
6. Finite-sum evaluation sends a into mS, hence induces compatible maps modulo
   every power. Their inverse limit into the complete S gives phi and the displayed
   values. Preservation of ideal powers proves continuity.
7. Outside aB, the first coordinate is nonzero in k. In each E/a^j a finite
   geometric series corrects a lift of its inverse. Uniqueness makes these inverses
   compatible, proving B local with maximal ideal aB and phi local.
8. Step 1 gives phi_*(J)=mS and phi_*(aB)=mS. Reduction of phi onto k is surjective.
   Apply lem-weil-pbc-complete-source-surjective-mod-ideal; B is precomplete and S
   is Hausdorff for mS. Surjectivity then identifies ideal maps with set images.
9. Empty monomial and parameter lists are allowed. When both are empty, A=k,
   both models are k, and the map is the identity. No-field coefficients cannot
   arise in that last case.
-/
theorem exists_completedChart_coefficient_surjection
    (A : Type u) [CommRing A] [IsNoetherianRing A] [IsLocalRing A]
    (P : Type v) [AddCommMonoid P]
    (_hfs : AlgebraicGeometry.IsFineSaturatedMonoid (Multiplicative P))
    (_hsharp : ∀ q : P, IsAddUnit q → q = 0)
    (a : Multiplicative P →* A)
    (_ha : ∀ q : P, q ≠ 0 → a (.ofAdd q) ∈ IsLocalRing.maximalIdeal A)
    (I : Ideal A) (_hI : I = Ideal.span {x | ∃ q : P, q ≠ 0 ∧ x = a (.ofAdd q)})
    [IsRegularLocalRing (A ⧸ I)] (n : ℕ) (u : Fin n → A)
    (_hu : IsLocalRing.IsRegularSystemOfParameters
      (List.ofFn (fun i ↦ Ideal.Quotient.mk I (u i)))) :
    IsLocalRing.maximalIdeal A = I ⊔ Ideal.span (Set.range u) ∧
    IsNoetherianRing (AdicCompletion (IsLocalRing.maximalIdeal A) A) ∧
    IsLocalRing (AdicCompletion (IsLocalRing.maximalIdeal A) A) ∧
    IsLocalRing.maximalIdeal (AdicCompletion (IsLocalRing.maximalIdeal A) A) =
      (IsLocalRing.maximalIdeal A).map
        (algebraMap A (AdicCompletion (IsLocalRing.maximalIdeal A) A)) ∧
    IsAdicComplete
      ((IsLocalRing.maximalIdeal A).map
        (algebraMap A (AdicCompletion (IsLocalRing.maximalIdeal A) A)))
      (AdicCompletion (IsLocalRing.maximalIdeal A) A) ∧
    Function.Bijective (IsLocalRing.ResidueField.map
      (algebraMap A (AdicCompletion (IsLocalRing.maximalIdeal A) A))) ∧
    ringKrullDim (AdicCompletion (IsLocalRing.maximalIdeal A) A) = ringKrullDim A ∧
    ((∃ (K : Type u) (_ : Field K), Nonempty (K →+* A)) →
      ∃ coeffMap : IsLocalRing.ResidueField A →+* AdicCompletion (IsLocalRing.maximalIdeal A) A,
        (AdicCompletion.evalOneₐ (IsLocalRing.maximalIdeal A)).toRingHom.comp coeffMap =
          RingHom.id (IsLocalRing.ResidueField A) ∧
        CompletedChartSurjection A P a n u (IsLocalRing.ResidueField A) coeffMap) ∧
    ((¬ ∃ (K : Type u) (_ : Field K), Nonempty (K →+* A)) →
      ∃ p : ℕ, Nat.Prime p ∧ CharP (IsLocalRing.ResidueField A) p ∧
        ∃ (C : Type u) (_ : CommRing C) (_ : IsLocalRing C), IsCohenRing p C ∧
          ∃ (e : (C ⧸ Ideal.span {(p : C)}) ≃+* IsLocalRing.ResidueField A)
            (coeffMap : C →+* AdicCompletion (IsLocalRing.maximalIdeal A) A),
            (AdicCompletion.evalOneₐ (IsLocalRing.maximalIdeal A)).toRingHom.comp coeffMap =
              e.toRingHom.comp (Ideal.Quotient.mk _) ∧
            CompletedChartSurjection A P a n u C coeffMap) := by
  sorry

end AddMonoidAlgebra
